# Git was rewriting every source file to CRLF in the working tree on checkout,
# so after any rebase/checkout the local files no longer matched the LF copies
# baked into the container image — every line of style.css read as "changed"
# and the asset content-hash shifted for no functional reason.
# Normalise to LF in the repo AND in the working tree.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
